# From Wave VIII - Union, appearing identically at the start of every Wave
# VIII tape (special-tour.gws through the-absolute.gws), introduced as "a new
# affirmation for the current stage of your journey." Not a fourth member of
# the @family affirmation group: those are interchangeable forms chosen once
# at F10 induction, all opening "I am more than my physical body." This one
# opens differently, is spoken again at F27 before each Wave VIII excursion,
# and isn't a substitute for the original -- a standing piece in its own
# right. @fixed for the same reason as the others: liturgy, not phrasing to
# vary.

@segment   affirmation-service
@title     The Gateway Affirmation — service form
@levels    F27
@fixed
@duration  ~1m

say Say in your mind. Say to yourself.
pause 4
say I am much more than my physical body. It is my intent, through these explorations beyond physical matter reality, to contribute to the expansion of human consciousness.
pause 8
say In consciously experiencing and acquiring knowledge of realms beyond ordinary consciousness, I will work to bridge these realities.
pause 6
say In so doing, I ask for help — to be open, allowing, and calm, and perceiving clearly, responding appropriately, and carrying out my intent of service.
pause 8
say I am truly grateful for this assistance. I set forth empowered by the energetic field of my fellow explorers, and acknowledgement of our oneness in love.
pause 10
